stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> scheduled: flow F02 creates run each morning
  scheduled --> in_progress: staff opens list
  scheduled --> missed: window passes, nothing done
  in_progress --> completed: all required checkpoints answered
  in_progress --> auto_closed: deadline reached, partially done
  scheduled --> cancelled: site paused (closure / refurb)
  missed --> [*]
  auto_closed --> [*]
  completed --> [*]
  cancelled --> [*]
  note right of missed
    Flow F03 alerts manager
    Shows in EOD report
  end note
